    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. King in a red velvet doublet with frogged fastenings, a white ermine cape with a modelled fur border, a metal crown, engraved bracers, cream trousers and tall cuffed boots. The cape's fur trim and the doublet back are complete geometry and the crown is a separate-looking but fused ring with points. Rigged: 24-bone humanoid armature, walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
    "limitations": [
      "AI-assisted origin (Meshy) is disclosed upstream; some storefronts require AI-content disclosure.",
      "The cape is skinned to the shoulders, not cloth-simulated, so it will not swing freely.",
      "The crown cannot be removed without editing the mesh."
    ],
